    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm heading into the pre-meeting with the Nebula board in an hour. They're going to grill us on the IP portfolio, specifically the data processing patent. How do you want me to frame the current status and strength of our patents to ensure we hit that $1.2B valuation target?",
