      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Address the litigation head-on, but immediately recontextualize it as a minor, predictable hurdle in a high-stakes market. Frame the challenge not as a threat, but as validation—it proves the technology is so disruptive that competitors are actively trying to block its adoption. Then, state confidently that our legal team has a preemptive defense strategy that makes the outcome a foregone conclusion, minimizing the financial risk to a negligible amount.",
