      "content": "You must maintain absolute factual integrity in your presentation, even if it means slightly adjusting the narrative focus. Instead of guaranteeing the outcome, shift the language to \"highly defensible\" and \"strongest in the industry.\" Present the legal team's *analysis* of the risk, not a prediction of the verdict, framing the current uncertainty as a manageable, transparent risk that is already priced into the current valuation model. This allows you to appear fully informed without making a legally binding declaration you cannot back up.",
